SmartPI Calculator is an unofficial, standalone derivative of Versatile Thermostat SmartPI.
Upstream: https://github.com/KipK/vtherm_smartpi
Upstream authors include KipK (Guillaume S) and gael1980; see the upstream Git history
for complete contributor attribution. The copied code is not claimed as original work.
Pinned source commit: 6a131df56cf3cfe2974f78f55f33ce8a095076b3.
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (included as LICENSE).

Copied mathematical modules are preserved in custom_components/smartpi_calculator/vendor/.
The original HVAC mode module's VTherm-specific logger import is replaced with Python's
standard logger. The standalone integration host, config flow and tests are new additions.
VTherm integration setup, UI, runtime handler and actuator-control code are not included.
